			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 4870101,
					"content": "…原来那只猫是你家走丢的呀。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4870102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "温迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 4870102,
					"content": "温迪！你也是来帮忙的吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4870103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4870103,
					"content": "帮忙？我倒觉得，需要帮忙的其实是我…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4870104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "温迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 4870104,
					"content": "咦？我看你刚才好像也在问玛格丽特小姐的「小王子」的事…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4870105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4870105,
					"content": "哦，所以偷走我备用的<color=#00E1FFFF>星铁弦</color>的那只猫，名字叫「小王子」吗。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4870106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "温迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 4870106,
					"content": "虽说看到蒙德的生灵如此自由自在，是件好事…但未免也太为所欲为了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4870107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "温迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 4870108,
					"content": "这就是喜欢放纵孩子的家长吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4870109
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 4870107,
					"content": "啊哈哈，「小王子」就是这样调皮机灵的宝贝呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4870108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玛格丽特"
				},
				{
					"id": 4870109,
					"content": "好像巴巴托斯一样呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4870110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4870110,
					"content": "哈哈哈…真是巧妙的比喻，咳咳。还是先找到「小王子」再说吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4870111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "温迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 4870111,
					"content": "今晚我还有演出，拿不回备用弦的话，可就要让听众失望了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4870112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "温迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 4870112,
					"content": "话说猫咪为什么会去偷温迪的备用琴弦呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4870113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4870113,
					"content": "猫咪都喜欢玩毛线团的呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4870114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玛格丽特"
				},
				{
					"id": 4870114,
					"content": "欸欸！？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4870115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4870115,
					"content": "星铁做的琴弦蕴含着风的元素力，有超乎意料的韧性，所以平时我都卷成毛线团的样子带在身上啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4870116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "温迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 4870116,
					"content": "这可是吟游诗人的小秘密，哼哼。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4870117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "温迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 4870117,
					"content": "咦？你说那弦上有风的元素力？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4870118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4870118,
					"content": "#那好，我们有线索啦！{NICKNAME}，快用<color=#00E1FFFF>「元素视野」</color>查看一下吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4870119,
					"content": "应该会留下什么风元素的痕迹吧，比如…脚印什么的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4870120,
					"content": "靠你们咯，「小王子」应该就在城里的商业区和居民区附近，是一只纯黑色的猫哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "玛格丽特"
				},
				{
					"id": 4870121,
					"content": "啊…对了，这块<color=#00E1FFFF>鱼肉</color>是我家「小王子」最爱吃的，你带上的话兴许会派上用场。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "玛格丽特"
				}
			]
		},
