					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4870502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4870502,
					"content": "想办法<color=#00E1FFFF>从它身后接近</color>吧，最好蹲下来，好让脚步轻一些。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4870503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4870503,
					"content": "不会飞就是麻烦，嘿嘿。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4870504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4870504,
					"content": "如果不放心的话，不如先用<color=#00E1FFFF>鱼肉</color>来吸引「小王子」的注意，猫都喜欢吃鱼的吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4870505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
