					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "温迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 4871006,
					"content": "呵呵呵…没抓到也别丧气嘛，至少功劳还是你们的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "温迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 4871007,
					"content": "唔~星铁弦果然还在这小家伙身上。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "温迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 4871008,
