				},
				{
					"id": 4871010,
					"content": "阿嚏——！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "温迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 4871011,
					"content": "咳咳…啊哈哈…离「小王子」这么近的话，我对猫过敏的体质果然又…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "温迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 4871012,
					"content": "怪不得你没有自己去抓它…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4871013,
					"content": "欸嘿，总之帮了大忙啦，那我先走啦…阿、阿嚏——",
